  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/661/661-4.htm",
  "statuteText": "661:4 Qualifications. –\n\nA person appointed or elected to fill a vacancy in a public office shall meet the qualifications of the office as provided in RSA 655:3-10 at the time of his election or appointment."
}
